      "originalText": "- this is what it sounds like.\n- it's a test from a users perspective, it's going to\nspin up a browser it's going to click through the \napp as if it were a person.\n- these sound great in theory but they are really \nbrittle. These are great for an established product\nat a company whos products don't change but not \ngreat for smaller companier here.\n- example: cypress.io",
