      "updated": 1793201769935,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Frontend testing is really good in theory but a lot of\ntimes it's really brittle and slows you down. They also\ntake a lot of time, there's times where it's good but \nI'd prioritize backend testing every day of the week.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Frontend testing is really good in theory but a lot of\ntimes it's really brittle and slows you down. They also\ntake a lot of time, there's times where it's good but \nI'd prioritize backend testing every day of the week.",
